{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4ca20fd7b4dde05ec11b52e6eab6928caadbd354153e25e9eb3dd438ed130c44","ja":"大晦日のミッション","zh":"除夕的任务","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"429ac7b0ecde485ee824d825f5534ed25ba3e3cc98a4b282ff777521b1389efa","ja":"お疲れさまです。\n大晦日まで勉強ですか。……みんな、えらいぞ。","zh":"辛苦了。\n到了除夕还要学习啊。……大家都很了不起哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0ac0f17f553521b38e4f16183969eb4dd81b8628064ca001af5ebf26c3912b0b","ja":"えへへ。\n杏奈ちゃんと一緒に、冬休みの宿題をしてるんです。","zh":"嘿嘿。\n我正在和小杏奈一起做寒假作业呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7a7832f24b7dc5f75e6dff51deeae59c7bb4b46b233b896b4df04faa844bf1d9","ja":"杏奈……もう、無理かも……。\n問1も……問2も……問3も……わからない……。","zh":"杏奈……可能已经不行了……\n第1题……第2题……第3题……全都不会……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"77c616b93015a264fcf3f496604b6e7e173dbf838c1f8d314b9a68170742ca8e","ja":"諦めないで、杏奈ちゃん！\n宿題が終わったら、イベントやり放題が待ってるよ！","zh":"不要放弃，杏奈！\n写完作业后，就可以尽情玩活动了哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d375f25d44c6432043c8b0735e1fde436c56a9c9014cb9b9f7d33c0da91f47cf","ja":"イベント、ですか？","zh":"活动，是吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"1628cce6a6d0a89c71f2a0d07cdd5dfd488b6f9d56356ed8c59699270c4323c9","ja":"はい！　私たちが好きなオンラインゲームが、\n年明けに大規模なイベントを開催する予定なんです。","zh":"是的！我们喜欢的网络游戏，\n计划在年后举办一场大规模活动。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ca6d259d1e9471fcb1fe47a74a222f8d6d8af54bdfe3ff8ab8772c12833ed7ee","ja":"だから先に……宿題、終わらせて……ゲームに、\n集中しようって……百合子さん……誘って、くれて。","zh":"所以百合子……约我先……把作业写完……\n再集中精神……玩游戏。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7c00f4e52af02d3299a5a27ab6bf1e4234a8fa62eb300ba40d92516b01eb109a","ja":"でも、全然……進まない……。ふたりなら……\nがんばれそうって、思ったけど……ダメ、かも……。","zh":"可是，完全……没有进展……原本以为两个人在一起……\n就能坚持下去……但可能，不行了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"72849fa0b298ae6a025e7517c1e56d8d8eedd5143b8a57d0ea8bb6b60e95b8a3","ja":"なるほど。そういうことでしたら、\n私がお手伝いしましょうか？","zh":"原来如此。如果是这样的话，\n要不要我来帮您？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"945df811c7c73e4cfdd4e82f3b3c2b572bc0822f2636e36414d721e5d8d98adf","ja":"えっ、いいんですか！？　実は私も数学が\n全然解けなくて、困ってたんです！","zh":"诶，真的可以吗！？其实我也\n完全解不开数学题，正犯愁呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1514.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3c478d04db7dbb35daa027fb9145cc3f4e53369e4bb6d940cdbfdaf4ed592f8d","ja":"はい、もちろん。\n数学ならどんとこい、だぞ。","zh":"好的，没问题。\n数学的话尽管交给我吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
